.nh
.TH "PB-BUGREPORT" "1" "Sep 2026" "Paperboat" "Paperboat CLI"

.SH NAME
pb-bugreport - Create a redacted Paperboat diagnostic bundle


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBpb bugreport [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Collect a bounded, redacted diagnostic bundle for support. The bundle holds a manifest,
recent events, redacted events and status. Nothing leaves this machine unless you pass --upload;
--record controls capture. The command prints where the bundle is and its support reference;
review it before you share it.

.PP
JSON output is supported with --json.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for bugreport

.PP
\fB--json\fP[=false]
	print JSON

.PP
\fB--record\fP[=false]
	record reproduction start and end markers

.PP
\fB--upload\fP[=false]
	upload the exact redacted bundle


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--config\fP=""
	path to the CLI config file

.PP
\fB--no-customization\fP[=false]
	ignore local shortcuts, command defaults, and TUI preferences

.PP
\fB--server\fP=""
	paperboat-server base URL override

.PP
\fB--workspace\fP=""
	resource workspace selector: personal or a team slug


.SH EXAMPLE
.EX
  pb bugreport
  pb bugreport --upload
  pb bugreport --json
.EE


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBpb(1)\fP
